Bp_JrMqMNc36-FuhtrXv3Ap8kzCQbYO48GmlRW0TpLCQeNRhTVCQq3W0Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWxp37LnTchve384O56N_QPXGz-7Qes7wjWvqajQF3v3Q&oe=6B0F0F46"}, {"file_name": "02-detail.png", "id": "1683881019522173", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821704_1683881026188839_4148983970693008391_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2egjaxNfQL0Q7kNvwFR7HHw&_nc_oc=AdpyCOZspKf6LfK4zPfxBMcdntyrFEKn5svPNIbSOhJnd6sO16DzfdTiw67AVdnD8II&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXUpVx55Ak5dhik9W1Osr6IuPydctT38emArw8WIyThFg&oe=6B0EED29"}, {"file_name": "04-home.png", "id": "1325026019199598", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823341_1325026022532931_3150413738957407970_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pRO-H30f_98Q7kNvwFNCaWZ&_nc_oc=AdrnBALUKfUnlXPmFkDnzLB2WMlU7kFrKTmxiz11bl_f5gSDCAh7UYp65tNkIDlwnxs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQX7uPuSGthTKNBElS0JtK7lWIzOG-YcRk2lLp-2aD-0fg&oe=6B0F1055"}, {"file_name": "03-library.png", "id": "996527066514223", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827585_996527069847556_5707853987992938826_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Br0TeFQ21UEQ7kNvwEiNKbI&_nc_oc=AdqffDgOa_UIecs8CfuYfmPC_S_2VovuoFAG2PwyVcl-Oo6Kb35gm1xv3k6H-r9dXfE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQW94LbzKvrF3gD7WTl2aA0FBRtsWHneEAVqozIyUmPYWQ&oe=6B0F098F"}, {"file_name": "06-network.png", "id": "2401194624048722", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_2401194627382055_1059502897790844367_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dLkLexcr60kQ7kNvwGxjJar&_nc_oc=AdpoTdov9ZOOn7Fr_HDu88GNlTBFDu5466nmuLda7C7pRHL_3xAaNt_fu33V7lcy2LU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQV7_X-20RdkBel9o3lG4KpKONUT_BAJlIjF5YeydsFqNg&oe=6B0EFEB3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "koko VR Theater", "keywords": ["plex", "jellyfin", "cinema", "vr180", "movies"], "long_description": "**Your library. Your cinema. Your headset.**\n\nkoko VR Theater turns your Quest into a private cinema for video you already own. Sign in to any Plex or Jellyfin server \u2014 yours, a friend's, or family's \u2014 or browse your NAS and local files. No accounts, ads, or subscriptions.\n\n**Play almost anything**\n- 2D, 3D (SBS / Top-Bottom / Frame-Sequential), VR180 / VR360\n- Apple spatial video (MV-HEVC), 3D Blu-ray (MVC), fisheye\n- HDR10, HLG, Dolby Vision; auto format detection\n\n**Looks better than the source**\n- Real-time AI upscaling (MQSR + NIS)\n- Per-title calibration: brightness, contrast, saturation, gamma, geometry\n- Up to native 8K from your servers and DRM-free web\n\n**Your whole collection, organised**\n- Plex & Jellyfin first-class \u2014 hubs, history, subtitles, audio tracks\n- Local, USB & network: SMB, FTP, SFTP, WebDAV, DLNA/UPnP\n- Tag, filter, sort, custom libraries; offline downloads; bookmarks & resume\n\n**Comfort & immersion**\n- Crisp UI, hand tracking, built-in VR web browser\n- Passthrough and skyboxes; spatial audio; subtitle styling; seated comfort\n\n**Watch together (optional)**\n- Private rooms with synced playback, voice chat, reactions; mute/block/report\n\n**Good to know:** commercial streaming (Netflix, Prime, Disney+) plays in theater-mode SD through the in-app browser due to hardware DRM. Full native resolution \u2014 up to 8K \u2014 applies to your own Plex/Jellyfin/NAS, local files, and DRM-free web like YouTube. koko plays content you own or are authorised to access.\n", "short_description": "Watch your own movies in a personal VR cinema. Connect Plex, Jellyfin, your NAS,\nUSB or local files. 2D, 3D, VR180/360, HDR \u2014 AI-upscaled and razor-sharp."}]}, "developer_name": "Krafti", "developer_privacy_